{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30013_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:903db93e4afd92e2b018a01e8b169973070b3cdf86fa70fd8b1c1eb3d5510029",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175fbfc0c8efb2b17f1a4e6714fbdc46f1f40e0c8ba1edc932791f39612333ff",
      "text": "Petit à petit l'oiseau fait son nid.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98eba98833021be6f23d03da6c3dd2f41c666833b45e2e27a31e2e3bd32ffb77",
      "text": "接下了出演电影联动蛋糕店工作的\nCafe Parade。其中负责以电影世界观为意象\n制作蛋糕的东云，立刻开始了试作，然而……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000030:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000030:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175fbfc0c8efb2b17f1a4e6714fbdc46f1f40e0c8ba1edc932791f39612333ff",
      "text": "Petit à petit l'oiseau fait son nid.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:627f31a4328f2082485e1847de55b171ace646f62b9b4a1af0030ec3a48c8d4f",
      "text": "由我们主演的电影《Monster of the Cake shop》，\n于今日正式公映了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5d38a1dd504dbf4334219a368f6e031be04785ecdcb5e8208ac5798c6cb3e94",
      "text": "然后，纪念公映的联动蛋糕店……\n“Candy Pop Monster”，也从今天起正式开业啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5711cf7e5edf7c90067b762b579e20a2eef570cde6a6c7186acd82b94424e52b",
      "text": "吾等同胞团奉上的诸般供品……\n光之民啊，且尽情沉醉享用吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f83b3375c93cb7916d55400cf3e5ba90ec35c5152f0b0fe8f67839c494c3944b",
      "text": "谢谢大家的光临☆\n我们会按顺序引导大家入座，请不要着急哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d958fcb3a83d150642067431e4c21a6fb45f76fbbf5f9e6ebdf14a6b7b81f1",
      "text": "我们还准备了适合搭配联动蛋糕的红茶哦。\n如果纠结于选哪种红茶，可以参考一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a6b3e7760088a6b88f557a24dc11ed103d19d7862b61da5eb4467f5512806c",
      "text": "好厉害啊！\n居然来了这么多人……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a85f2a3f2f3a6cbb86dbf88ffb9b521998d4cb72eead7c2cb6ade811e2b36a3",
      "text": "是的。看来有这么多人一直在期待着\n“Candy Pop Monster”的开业呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb3227ce370454f55c7e52de53466f736be693e8fb9f35ebd44900b8dfb22508",
      "text": "无论是作为偶像还是作为糕点师，\n都没有比这更让人高兴的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_a:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b3bb05becc88c64890b721f690fbff7bbf98793c011fd686173d24dc92ad16",
      "text": "嗯！虽然直到今天经历了各种波折……\n但能平安迎来开业真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81317062f43c4cfc1e4ce7c0b2e868359d54d427855b9a7cf2158783677baec5",
      "text": "嗯～久违的临时营业，真好玩～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adc498c59fa8133fa0749297f0c0b2c64b9f351c3128bcb8244c8d1fddefa9ca",
      "text": "我也觉得好开心啊。\n之前太忙了，一直抽不出时间开店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:321419196491be94d2dcf21d4910dc711cfff99d45fca99f8090d581bff18012",
      "text": "嗯。再过一段时间，我们Cafe Parade\n出演的电影就要上映了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe374e0c58c9b3146cd5d4b3589717429ea74438d20c655e8fbdafe6f522125",
      "text": "宣传和采访的工作接下来也会逐渐增加，\n日程会变得更加忙碌哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2d54b57bb2665c8745bfdbe18dbc38c50b394048d1f109d5363a1205a939c9",
      "text": "是啊。\n话说回来距离公映也没剩多少时间了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708dc2aee1dcf19e948a3631e846b00684496fcf0065061d5cf0627cc914ca76",
      "text": "总觉得前几天才刚杀青，\n时间过得可真快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d4c1783eb39115d16d86f12064494931daca9c2ccf69b9b8bdbb0e7ffd4873",
      "text": "拍摄虽然辛苦但也很有趣呢～\n真想早点在电影院看到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc709644a5476e5c7f23435ad57c648b84e8ac08dbe0b47ca674d7225c02e99",
      "text": "嗯。封印了吾等同胞团英姿的幻影……\n真希望能早日让光之民一睹为快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1df8cad092d9f652ed8ac4fceec2abf379b0a1bdc35002d1eb31e37aa4bf0ed",
      "text": "“现身吧糖果流行怪兽！将这城镇里的\n糕点师统统吞噬殆尽吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96111a5ebbc5b4cf34ad0f627539b30c90547c51eaecbf601aeb27581322a133",
      "text": "哈哈，阿斯兰真是演了个非常适合你的角色啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f41104df16cbcfa8d978d7722e8d4c1ea518735e7da33b9fc3b22694b135e2",
      "text": "嗯。而且，那部作品充满了对蛋糕的爱意。\n哪怕只是为了一个镜头，也会特地准备货真价实的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73c73dc1667b9ea588d024413c58fd694d9cfc0926b2a7201c700694e65b83cf",
      "text": "拍摄结束后分给大家的蛋糕，每一款都绝顶美味！\n特别是在高潮部分出现的那款蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03070f2ca80ccd4fc95c3d941ae0710cb6247bfb713d41907a082fb312f71bd7",
      "text": "是的。那是极其细腻且精彩的极品呢。真想下次找机会\n好好钻研一番它究竟运用了怎样的技巧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:589be23455aa297486e70a1fb3f707e61a701ae3e33000727c8c17c051e26ddd",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000219:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99b87707bac75920a0ba479f24f951690dc78eabc600c98b82bb3e08d4a6436e",
      "text": "啊，制作人。辛苦了。\n一直在等您呢。您说的重要事情，是指什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_b:cmd-000229:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db603e4ad3d3c596fb22588b2e66cce42ae3555da1dcd2ec24e01b1ca1d41ac3",
      "text": "好的。其实是接到了新工作的邀约……\n请大家过目这份企划书！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d10629ebc983b83c9044339889165f0407427e748cc4aba8bdc9b9429d864b04",
      "text": "联动蛋糕店“Candy Pop Monster”\n……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93871c2097cca89f1f901e2c94eca889a88e876ca07d8dbfe42bf9f03f4fb3b7",
      "text": "是的！配合电影的公映，对方希望能限期\n开设一家蛋糕店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5100ebd8f162ceed69937ace04efc002c3dbdccf77e3465fe27d9bbe2ae1e2cb",
      "text": "唔。为了幻影的揭晓，\n需要寻求吾等暗之同胞团的协助，是这个意思吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c31da703ddbab500edf7df37d3ec3625d2b182c92a3850a0edb152c715a97cb",
      "text": "是的！对方希望请大家以电影的世界观为意象\n设计出一款蛋糕。另外……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2bba4bf360824b5b395fde01a4638b902484e4565dfcfeffaaf038497ac9768",
      "text": "对方还发来邀约，希望各位能在开业首日\n亲自来店接待顾客。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ede959e83dccc5a2650c3ba70a7d993c190129ecdd45acc0de1a0c9c3e5a8c",
      "text": "听起来超级好玩～♪\n人家很想做！大家觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef89be0b09cc03e8d64864aa974691943cba34f6ded62c5a3dac526a04ac7228",
      "text": "我也希望能做呢。\n庄一郎先生觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b4776c472f8ffc6b0eeedd8e59e6ca7f3e15c60dfe4a0a7e50f81b3d9ab847",
      "text": "……难道，您觉得我会拒绝吗？\n制作人，请务必让我接受挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee846842004301b6f396c9a4616992f4092b6be9e1de842f15816aff9af13818",
      "text": "谢谢。当天，\n店内似乎还会附设堂食区域。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bac38ad4f2c3be7663db3e979724f9bd9ad7d5334a7210db7b4f5b376b26c3eb",
      "text": "既然如此，我也想提供红茶呢。\n制作人，您看如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3141723acd589f536285a8389b20d87e71a925dd9850ae9d2f2ddf57344254d7",
      "text": "好主意。我这就去向对方提议！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9cc473973c6eb1468842002e4e00e312135c03c948a00cc00f58a7c1dfa6569",
      "text": "库库库……这意味着吾等的精髓将接受考验吗。\n很好！此刻正是解放深藏于吾身之力之时！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fdc52a9ec0bcb964619ddc9878b9bc1f252d395364fde0e241e05574f66f18",
      "text": "首先为了把握电影的氛围，我借用了工作人员\n提供的配方将蛋糕还原了出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65f01d428f469eb25e3d62514865521320208bac4a59c6422c74b5b155684b24",
      "text": "好～厉害！\n和在拍摄现场看到的蛋糕一模一样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a88eb034d295e7da0a77a9949d93863da2c47852ab4d9be29bc1298ebcdcb88",
      "text": "味道嘛……唔。极美。\n不愧是庄一郎，果真精妙绝伦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b74aae96b5439119329cd159de4fbb2ea93570c251372519edc33f6123cb27",
      "text": "是的。\n能在这么短的时间内做出如此水准的作品……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09947bae56d7b39c638f834314183ae526399733883380fc27fd8c579497d3e5",
      "text": "感谢各位的夸奖。\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e7131484e53b06ea16df00ed98417b3cb525c8334127b662239af88be7dc9b",
      "text": "难道说，有什么问题吗？\n我觉得无论是味道还是卖相，都已经完美无缺了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6c65ec5ddae70f1883f28ab29c61fcc7e8450f9225b9b7838fc0787234c074",
      "text": "不，正如卷绪先生所说。\n味道和卖相，我认为都已经还原得很到位了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59f61b4b9c8602e04e613ce9b2faa917bb8c444cd8d146e7b4479553d7488b02",
      "text": "只是按目前的做法……抱歉。\n能容我稍微思考一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715623166277d3d26bf8044ad79a8a3522d18466a71c3bf95ae6787ffe9a02c4",
      "text": "庄一郎先生，到底是怎么了呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19589a4f0cae9ce7cf7b4f1b5bd82314021c030baccf9b492d3105f6d20e6776",
      "text": "……大概是，心中有什么纠结吧。\n我试着找机会委婉地问问他看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542976e80496b91abda6d50e81cb646605bfb37697ca147799d7331dfc6f44ae",
      "text": "怎么了，东云。\n难得看到你陷入瓶颈的样子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaf1946386cca48aa46d62bfbaea118197ada345aa6d44141f9427c7dd2290fb",
      "text": "神谷。不，并没有那回事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962fb1e0bf464fd765c793916bd8d3bbee5ab9ff4f84fdf6c396cb1fd93c23a1",
      "text": "怎么可能没事。卷绪他们也一直在担心你呢。\n难道是在蛋糕试作上遇到了什么难题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8a65b896c2c31e534801a1622daad1b57a34bd31fde51bf641d8f329263537",
      "text": "……果然瞒不过神谷你们啊。\n是的。确实为那件事稍微有些烦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f646550696323d95218591ed7c3692af3fe02479b92aec86e5d128bf9457e5",
      "text": "前几天，我用借来的配方\n还原了电影里的蛋糕对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab640b73bb7a38ba0b01d5377b0f465b7717171676b01632d9a7790d61e05c8",
      "text": "嗯。\n无论是外表还是味道都无可挑剔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ccbd944827ee0667d2ed95735e02a32ade59c69c94f473932c960b16cac3f9a",
      "text": "谢谢你的夸奖。\n但是，那其实是一个未完成品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece5c36d57c4023ebeb253bd38ba771db82cbbb60c34b922f138904e89b4e64c",
      "text": "卖相虽然模仿得十分相像，但我却没能\n真正还原出那款极品的细腻精髓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d52fc05d2a867cdc361c4cc10ce9ea4dfe264824abe35101ae290964470e8964",
      "text": "自那之后我又试做了几次蛋糕，\n却始终做不出能让自己满意的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab11baf8f9452d7971496e872ad62e53ca8a9e6933281b243069ca9e2e80cd8a",
      "text": "我所欠缺的不仅是技艺，更是经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d61cb627e8749483be157479f7b2f37f8e27a1fb84d351ddaa124d2e3d5699b9",
      "text": "凭现在的我，根本做不出像电影里出现的那款蛋糕那样……\n足以俘获人心的作品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fed9dc1ce031a9bcd722d6671bed692e2c57f4aa09f1b52a95e7a26eb6574e1d",
      "text": "东云……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afaa3779d0b79b6aed4c6123ed84a365db8866911a90f68d126f5b2c101fb275",
      "text": "……抱歉。\n对你说了这些丧气话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff150671313fa8e66750699617a20a55778c09dd66486aa5dff88bccc3024359",
      "text": "不，你能跟我倾诉我很高兴哦。\n确实，经验至关重要啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:131707f10270b803a5cae94d375e753d495af2f7904628697254c44e848b0bb9",
      "text": "虽然不知道能不能给你作参考……\n我也曾周游过形形色色的国家，学到了许许多多的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3892413ea687cb9eb473292f56732fd0f1ddaa581adec9f46e922cb96679fb93",
      "text": "我觉得正是那段经历造就了现在的我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e504be1b62ba885b5e5e2a794055eaa81ad0f158bb470aba1c65cc866d5f63",
      "text": "是啊。正因为神谷通过旅行结下的缘分，我才能\n作为糕点师来到Cafe Parade。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16c6bfa294163aee79ee9bd9ba8ad7778e57fba512704ee71ca4b2f222568fae",
      "text": "嗯。所以，东云也亲自去经历一番就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adeaf42e1e76769872c575a21a75ff54f6a0b99a96940fe4fbb4cb15e71c5c1f",
      "text": "意思是让我像当年的神谷一样踏上旅途……\n是这个意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85e7731d8d71331d48705b6e130522570ab4628687c54c8b2026b191c1c1c8a6",
      "text": "监制《Monster of the Cake shop》中蛋糕的\n那位糕点师，我记得是在巴黎开店的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b6daa7efc72c389cf2e5c569301120853c093b2b02ac0aed69c180f2da24358",
      "text": "既然如此，你也去一趟巴黎吧。\n去那座法式糕点的激战区进修，你觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9269e10dae19d3c707bafdd5908a88bab33db934a4b31786e333fe07b459dafc",
      "text": "……呵呵，神谷这不按常理出牌的性格总是能让人大吃一惊呢。\n谢谢你。感觉眼前的道路豁然开朗了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a447babcfbc9cbf30576e143806d1a00e4cd9f066d164d9f3430eb47f0a07c2",
      "text": "我这就去和制作人商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89111a2810e8841f5d5bd7b7a432d0c2dac065c55a47ef6efc999dd91d036868",
      "text": "如果能够成行的话，\n我有一件想要尝试的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19586e6eadbe374768285252da33156f54582d42d93582ac0edeebf805cf0a90",
      "text": "哎！和我去法国！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2684655287eb22f24f935e0580000b6d1d77b8c3e32d28b9395b1581b584fa0",
      "text": "是的。当然，前提是卷绪先生愿意的话。\n行程手续方面制作人会帮我们安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ca3c87f3000d193e49d612ed42108e1d0427529a2534378d386e08244242474",
      "text": "自从前几天试做蛋糕以来，我一直在思考。\n我心中所欠缺的正是经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ff67c127d7282575e52a2a4ddb8b95c06f13692fd69570ac20fa13b3190c45",
      "text": "我想前往正宗的法国，在甜点的圣地\n汲取全新的见识。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d4cb1ce7ff94198bf77bce91f2bd4d9fb65aa4ea1f90374d11a9a2d39f2bcae",
      "text": "而在这趟旅程中，如果有深爱着蛋糕的\n卷绪先生相伴，我想必会倍感安心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6faa22fab8fd3e130913a194854dcba65f0b7a5cbf5499cf267ab89b8537a11f",
      "text": "如果是我们两个人，一定能够制作出\n绝妙的蛋糕。能请你借我一份力量吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fdd3c0e84a31b026c236aaf1ec4c705767344ef38ef85b22fbe04e161fc40fa",
      "text": "……那当然，我绝对要去！毕竟，\n我们可是爱蛋糕协会的会员同伴不是吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0208bdca0ed3f90cfd5e743518199aa84e6561b6823a131efef12a72d38bc5f",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n我就知道你会这么说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0a80044c9b80dccc18e775e7cd04680133ab64637496d73a14692fec2b98a1a",
      "text": "另外还有一件事。\n制作人非常努力地帮我们争取到了机会哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8098d54734140ddf0501a7a48ddbb098e62f112fef9483472e5d5d78db0caac7",
      "text": "据说通过电影剧组的工作人员，我们能见到\n负责监制电影蛋糕的那位糕点师本人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade409ee54f1111fec5964fa241524874cd1d0a3a67850eea7d02a01d66e0b6a",
      "text": "是真的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:957e2e63452f49bfb7aeeea032a88930d0aa20857bec5251357b8d9c73973311",
      "text": "是的。只要能当面聆听他的见解，\n应该又会有所领悟吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17749c57441bf4113b148f0d07e4a979b86fe6652465afbd59f2ac8f0377808d",
      "text": "哇……好期待啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a31c107a42742595b66983d76d7d985032cfba04b8d6560f2910289098068559",
      "text": "是啊。难得有这样的机会。\n让我们把它变成一趟收获满满的、充实的旅程吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000121:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2102d2182cda39b8a1a6e0f6b690d3954474afb93fd7c9931acac1b4ae0feb5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天，非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:825f55b2f9edb32b6f995915718a4c03bc0c96598ed08c3398f5d7de2f612001",
      "text": "另外，看来之前让您\n多费心了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea996874573f27ad5b292c79b1f109ba42cf3bf16bbc0b0ba8c624b409b46fa",
      "text": "老实讲，虽然我确实苦恼过，\n但相比之下，心中更多的是雀跃的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4bf96b6566d8718aad68d1a55e29537fa480e1196a812b84857fd9077acdab4",
      "text": "毕竟这次尝试还原的蛋糕，\n是一件需要高超技艺的作品，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ba69479699866080701efdae361c51fbfac7ba5ea99d0fb96c3a510d61fcdc",
      "text": "在制作的过程中，反而彻底点燃了\n我更进一步的探索之心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60fa0f860d07b36e4b3673da804d23ec9a4e8c8994272909daffb2d31003902",
      "text": "想要做出更能“让人回想起电影并乐在其中的蛋糕”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59d23e5bc82a2c5a9094823fe82e98a7ee699f1a1279615ea4716c89d98af3b6",
      "text": "如今这份探索之心，\n究竟该驶向何方，终于清晰明朗了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7333d7c5966f990fc44ed3433be4848fea61fd5009b2ab99064dda8934d7fedb",
      "text": "我将与Cafe Parade的蛋糕王子——卷绪先生同行，\n前往巴黎开拓眼界。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b641229c4fcf3bf5aacadd4d69f0533dbd9a20c320956046bf0da60ee00c1f",
      "text": "我会支持你们的！\n请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e652a2a1a92d83c5c16ab26664e7013f899f8669845e72ff54ad70a4c977ce91",
      "text": "非常感谢您。能得到您这番话，\n我也能够怀揣自信踏上旅途了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_g:cmd-000156:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b92d5426ef5fb3c200b32df9ac4cf59b90fdb067b946000f37213c548c93d6e",
      "text": "虽然会有一小段时间不在店内……\n不过一切就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee159da4c218d2dc73143b4b4afe61c399f52b024cc2ef99b814a55ee7192ba",
      "text": "会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:772d19dbb4367bdf0e7ae0eaf4179cba806aa075e76a980682ed45fb7565adf0",
      "text": "大家快看快看！卷卷和庄一郎\n把在当地做的蛋糕照片发过来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e226f5834b1dd274576968c640572ed6c316798cc08f226b5f8908d9bdf2a212",
      "text": "听说是在去拜访西点师的店时，\n承蒙对方的好意让他们试着制作的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095e20d7c796e46f22c6b51a7d42c06d35dda132d7a53fbe6193be535838d18c",
      "text": "嚯，这……相当称得上是一件逸品啊。\n看来庄一郎已经掌握了全新的精炼之术！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3bac568f42bd1a8f163b9e8cf0b014224588bf64225f345d907a6ffce2f730c",
      "text": "看来两个人都在努力呢。\n我们也不能认输啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84c425e0f51511817e93e05742724075627f722fa08f9c148ce706f92bea32f",
      "text": "嗯！为了让蛋糕显得更加出彩，\n必须准备好最棒的舞台才行呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7288e8fdf021ef915569262fc0e2bfa2e56c8810bf6ee80cf2c3159a1ca599",
      "text": "嗯！那么我们这就重新开启圆桌会议吧！\n距离彼之试炼，所余时刻已经不多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b42d23c4092f8dbc3f5076340795630eea7220df7d4471e6e05aae074f6a4d84",
      "text": "好——！我有些装潢方面的事\n想和阿斯兰商量。可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b32b8db2a1cfd47354e3ea7291474b62dd07fa947b5b0c7e4376d75eca861e1",
      "text": "无妨！吾亦要委托汝等，试吃在与幻影相交织之诱惑之馆里\n所呈奉的祭品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:006f47c31039fd793f35fc746861dd25ecbdb90761dfffb1100ae6fe5f90f6bb",
      "text": "（咲和阿斯兰都干劲十足啊。\n去了巴黎的两个人似乎也很努力……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a8e10557ba2c0592a4da6a7f7d8ac5b8a60a0d29d340942836c8b66cb13c80b",
      "text": "（等他们回来之后，我也必须找出\n最配这款蛋糕的拼配茶才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000161:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f82334b003bac14b1e94cd70660c4c0933a534c5af3da28711caf10c6ee1a854",
      "text": "然后，几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a41acda2d26e5de2da1cd05944de8bb226eda06c30fc121486b93a7da2991c3b",
      "text": "欢迎回来，两位。巴黎怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e064d922bb790d6d81feb4950e18be55a3ae111320f6046c03faa2e4ccb84cb0",
      "text": "真不愧是发源地……\n所见所尝的一切，都让人深受触动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a7990327b513b772c0309f97bb52fa3b6d8c05130d19deebf4649b4024e56df",
      "text": "是的。让我们获得了难能可贵的经验。\n这趟旅程的目的也好好达成了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000231:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75aca11f6aaf0cf2e91d47c311cfee906de61608e18c551b25a591be5d3c15de",
      "text": "嗯。气色不错。\n想必度过了一段极为充实的时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ba7cd439f5df37e20244788f4ea29b97d7f4d3d45b0ddd72d1fbe37520066e2",
      "text": "呐，快让我们看看修行的成果吧！\n我一直超级期待的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_h:cmd-000249:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec33ef02817184b2690d76b5b1ae03ea0d153bc6ba54b1f24a61e8b63d6cfc8d",
      "text": "当然可以。来吧，卷绪先生。\n接下来可就要忙起来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d06e127931026fde763dc2248b09d364d3f9f60fb118bd8d2841dbfc9c4074e",
      "text": "请用吧。这是结合了卷绪先生的\n建议后完成的新作蛋糕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7c58af608a75842beba3010b6cbbdc804ec767f37fd081977be7e0b68e505e",
      "text": "《Cafe Parade的Candy Pop Monster蛋糕》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea01b44880d20b216e1aaae41882b7f2e33471e66ef753dae723e39e5bb3b3dd",
      "text": "这款蛋糕的主题是“本真的欲望”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac7f3392b05b669cf51e450d58d3bd2a127209831662e8e7e7c417be64cf2350",
      "text": "摘下乖孩子的面具，沉溺于蛋糕的甜美之中……\n我们试着将其打造成了这种具有魅惑感的味道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950ed6df0a524727661be153c4852a503e086ff5d38c6bff276d0f6ac30fd4dd",
      "text": "看起来好美味的巧克力蛋糕啊！\n那我这就开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470edbe90617029510ca06f2154a9f48f994ea8690b41662a9feecd42ca43a97",
      "text": "……！这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:503d85cfebdb2b4b5afa0573d07f86dbfc5169814231bd3b7ad05387a27a81ac",
      "text": "和从前尝过的诱惑祭品相比，\n简直判若两物……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:024479b5a34e2d8b8012ecc26f53f5061079748940c305e8ad074a426583d9b8",
      "text": "嗯。虽然外观乍看之下很朴素，但吃上一口\n就能明白连细节处都被照顾得面面俱到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b311bf98c78db063d86860369d055dc1d88b0b1ffbe51f019c0728920b996985",
      "text": "嗯嗯！\n客人们一定也会喜欢的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e0836d801ec11860d35ffe462e6ffc27a44b53f2716ca84c06c03b7d4a14f5",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖。因为从第二天起，\n也会有我以外的人来制作这款蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e52657773cf187c7fa1bf257d79b934ebf79a09cac6833fe809a39ebae8191",
      "text": "所以我尽量考虑到了要容易重现。\n当然……绝对没有做任何妥协。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1971d669d833ece7e63d5a82a78374ca346eedf7aec8839df2a267553779ebcb",
      "text": "裹缠着甜美暗黑之泪的罪孽深重之诱惑祭品……\n如此一来，想要诱使光之遗民堕入暗黑亦是轻而易举！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:810c8bb87cdea56dfe4a7ed9c00f34f21d4671ab83a72b0c01438629faeafe56",
      "text": "汝等久等了。由庄一郎与卷绪的异国见闻\n获得灵感之逸品……好生品尝吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b557694c735ce1245c295f6b2c224de655e266496e1e152b0c415496501dbf1",
      "text": "这是肉冻冷餐吗。\n横切面非常漂亮呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be891cdd9913be6d4b1215c71c9d18312a1c1e02ef0c02d598206ab5ecea0940",
      "text": "华丽程度完全不输给蛋糕呢。我也准备了\n用来搭配他们两人的蛋糕的拼配茶哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6f92318f26eb32951a9f2a0bbaeee92546778d0e474d843fc666400acac38ea",
      "text": "好香啊。\n而且，和蛋糕也很相配！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de916ae6aef131c073572cbabf865ff9b40659c172c56e0c92a304971f15a636",
      "text": "配合他们两人做出来的蛋糕，\n我选择了风味强劲的乌瓦红茶作为基底。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66f3362523b9fe1534c9cc4b23bc8e8d2237ad6068c3da14cfcc92e104ae7e94",
      "text": "乌瓦红茶带有的涩味和巧克力的甜味能够互相\n映衬，一定会把彼此的魅力都激发出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f36bea5ed6042c2c26357a450c8183370141636c8dbf3caeb37c93f723b8201",
      "text": "回味很清爽呢！\n这样的话感觉蛋糕再吃多少块都吃得下……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c3380d548b90ce8d9465b0fda2e8865ee9ba66cd6c1cff55cb57464e5272ff2",
      "text": "这样一来，联名蛋糕店的准备工作\n就全都就绪了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d45d75a582525b6740ce858ff2ccd2b10b30f46bcebd05789d114570e97548d",
      "text": "是的。接下来就静待正式开张的那天吧！\n大家真的都辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000218:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118f0f85fd27aba008f52b95f00488ca2372a900fd27c5153c19cb7ef2873a02",
      "text": "“Candy Pop Monster”开业！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000233:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:784dfeddaca4d4d14c33ef598f545f4f69cb5f24fb8aea5240fbf9b93a167063",
      "text": "联名蛋糕店的生意真是盛况空前啊！\n咲负责的店内装潢在客人们中间也大受好评的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c904169cb409e9c88f7fed60899f26cacdfc389333753ce1d949d089f84689",
      "text": "是啊。大家都在开开心心地拍照呢。\n太好了呢，咲酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000260:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:480cac8da509c058735758cc7fad210817f67ae17c2584203c225928d3314481",
      "text": "谢谢啦～♪\n阿斯兰也帮忙了，谢谢你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000269:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e61668be0276a0f5530c2513ee2e643a4703ed8352e877a1a52279db6aade0",
      "text": "否也。此乃咲之努力的结晶。\n撒旦亦在赞颂汝之功绩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000303:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0859e1ac11275f7387cec92962dbb365f86f4afabfeab67d79423ef656cb704c",
      "text": "虽然走到今天经历了不少辛苦，\n但能平安顺遂地达成比什么都好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000398:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000411:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:277bfda89ff97536fa1969b9aac0cdebd17a571f43459d8587afd723f785f957",
      "text": "卷卷和庄一郎在巴黎拍的照片，\n不管看多少次都好棒<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000413:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37e4b9fdbd57b99aced2d7db5b2b392f03aa6502d238fa9b37f44107ab990e86",
      "text": "是啊\n街景果然很漂亮呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000415:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15955eed32d8063ee68432dcd3e992cfc1c0bc43e12411d265bf58fca97e1b04",
      "text": "虽然以前在照片上见过，\n但亲眼目睹果然非同凡响！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000417:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed7338dc911f0b0a00d2f1120e51b6c34a65453ac760eb7500c439b6399fa803",
      "text": "让人深切感受到\n他们一定非常珍视\n古老的街景吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000419:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb664dbd00729ad1d0beec2642742c6391a89fad687dbb67e8d68ab696a1c04",
      "text": "是的。埃菲尔铁塔还有凯旋门。\n巴黎圣母院也\n庄严而美丽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000421:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2df6cc89e93a4b0c1ecd69ba47b756242f475077e619554f08ef3a4b2d85cea",
      "text": "真好啊～！\n我也想去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000423:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bca5316468dc3fed6f20ccf8c62e4143def00205fc26775fd7e04cab50310146",
      "text": "好想和Cafe Parade的大家\n一起漫步香榭丽舍大街啊<emoji>image_talk_emoji_25</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000425:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f57743eafcd87bb34e0ae97038d986e6ac1231e5349bcaf5a0af48b4db58af",
      "text": "真想在遥远的异国之地\n筑起我等之据点啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000427:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:001443214719ebe77d697a33c79b835a44b5da2e111e716c1eb17b628f521fa1",
      "text": "意思是Cafe Parade在巴黎开分店？\n那感觉超级棒的耶♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000429:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f91be977236ea0f5961c2c49464b5c9850156b6f50dc64ef90451e68cc871804",
      "text": "梦想就要远大嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000429:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10f1d0578b827e2237065782e4cbbdd3aee8c48bdfa646c5989d0be5a2fc875f",
      "text": "梦想就要远大嘛！\n我也会帮忙的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000430:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef083c2eaa66bb52fd18a7205b28daaa1cf0c27b4580ca4a1bb88ccec38f3e80",
      "text": "用我们的表演去招待他们吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000430:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a782301b4a4a2cf4c98991e518975be0ff47bfdd9d4586bebc2a8790a68687a",
      "text": "用Live来好好招待\n巴黎的各位吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000434:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b12a6ce62c2be4e2f2906ab4b92ab1a7b238bdeadc5d1cf9641711f69eb73a0",
      "text": "要是真有那么一天的话\n会很让人高兴呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000436:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf0f6acb994ffad68e14a71b240b050478ea53580c521e03751600704aa3a01c",
      "text": "我等只需面向那一天\n精进魔力即可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_j:cmd-000438:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c59c676fcea6ba6c380f2489f354eb53e0911c8a21eb8bb2bab7945f9fa0f89c",
      "text": "是啊。总有一天，\n一起去见巴黎的客人们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76db31846c1173797f677d764c03fcaa62beac4ded8ef31d282dfeab80733d0a",
      "text": "这次的工作大家也辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc4875b0d3db65a438d23d1fa2c853c6d86b63635170bdfc7611609cd053c018",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n也十分感谢您的从旁协助。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e85db6c1fc46456a901bb82e27616e2079d50027295ae3a08af590e919373988",
      "text": "我也想向您道谢。非常感谢您\n能让我们去巴黎！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fc52ae14de9945217f1ff976c25d3f2fbe0889a71bd275287e561227d55c827",
      "text": "哪里，我并没有做什么了不起的事。\n不过能帮上忙真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ffebd62c75c5e77167b03a27f4b7f8f62bf5659ee73d2e0e385422604e62a5a",
      "text": "我们自己玩得开心，而且客人们\n看起来也收获了满满的幸福呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02589558c45904c6fa73f1f4d7063db73105da8a06f1c8765a5705bad31aecb4",
      "text": "嗯。吾亦听闻有不少声音\n期盼与幻影交织之诱惑之馆能够重现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f49f56c3e52569d2d6f56270ec74e30557a51b192ac9a3153d83b7ffbae067",
      "text": "如果未来还有机会再次开店的话，\n届时就向大家展现更加强大的我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ec251da3b46962790f099df302eeec6a0378bd6b4dbbcd24efb0d02b4bcb30",
      "text": "为了这一天，首先就让我们在今天的庆功宴上\n好好犒赏一下自己吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d9dc55cfefdb528a467d282a73b52d2cea2e6193aef33c1dbafb7d5a11e6454",
      "text": "大家的饮料都拿好了吗？\n那么……干杯——☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_k:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
